Anglicans represent the third largest body of Christians in the world, speaking many languages and coming from many different races and cultures.

The&nbsp;[**Anglican Church in North America**](http://anglicanchurch.net/)&nbsp;is united with the overwhelming majority of provinces in the worldwide Anglican Communion. The ACNA unites 160,000+ Anglicans in 1,200+ congregations across the United States, Canada and Mexico into a single Church.
